[N 31-33 City of Dalaran]
[D Forever Shaman 30-60 (Braedyn)\\The City of Dalaran (Forever's new 30s dungeon in the Alterac crater): the four Kirin Tor quests, the Defender of Dalaran, one run, then back to Southshore.]
[GA Alliance]
[OC]|cffffffffLevel check|r  -  This chapter wants level 32-33: the four quests are level 33 (required 24), and the mob levels inside are not in the data. Under 32: bring a group that is 33+, or run it at the end of chapter 29 (Refuge Pointe flies to Southshore direct)
[OC]|cffffffffSouthshore|r  -  you start in Southshore; hearth = Southshore and it stays there. One dungeon, the City of Dalaran in the Alterac crater, |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r. Required chapter: three normal quests (11,850 XP, but only Starving Arcane's 3,950 is handed in here) and one grind/luck quest with a small follow-up (4,215 XP more if the Arcane Mote drops)
[OC]|cffffcc00Log check:|r A Green Sample (92456) and Power Overwhelming (92489) from Stormwind (chapter 15), Starving Arcane (92457) and Heart of Disruption (92458) from Modera (chapter 27; Heart of Disruption gave you the Dalaran Sewer Key). Nothing to train here
[OC]|cffffcc00Sources:|r quest ids, objectives, item stats and boss drops come from the Forever DB and the Wowhead Forever tooltips. Mob levels, elite status, the layout and the entrance are not in the data: Questie maps the dungeon mobs onto the city itself in the Alterac Mountains (x14-22, y55-76), so the pins inside are approximate

[OC]|cffffffffTo the crater|r  -  on foot from Southshore. Dalaran has no flight point
Leave Southshore north-west to the Hillsbrad Fields [G33,42 Hillsbrad Foothills]
Go on north-west through the pass into the Alterac Mountains [G18,72 Alterac Mountains]
Meet your group at the [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera] outside the city [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[OC]|cffffcc00Entrance (unverified):|r the sources disagree. Method: north-west outside the city, opened with the Dalaran Sewer Key from Heart of Disruption. foreverdb: through the Underbelly, no key. The pin below (8.5,59.2) is from an earlier note with no data behind it. Follow your tank if they know the way in
|cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r Enter the City of Dalaran (entrance unverified, see above) [G8.5,59.2 Alterac Mountains]

[OC]|cffffffffThe City of Dalaran|r  -  |cFFFF0000GROUP 5|r, quests level 33 (requires 24). One run, never a re-run. Your quests, with the honest label:
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Starving Arcane (92457) - 8 Seeking Remnants, 8 Saturated Remnants and 8 Mana Echoes - |cff66ff66normal|r: the trash of the clear. 3,950 XP at Modera outside
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Power Overwhelming (92489) - slay the Mana Elemental, the boss Arcanic Enigma - |cff66ff66normal|r. 3,950 XP and 1 gold at High Sorcerer Andromath in Stormwind (chapter 30)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r A Green Sample (92456) - 1 Fel Infused Blossom - |cff66ff66normal|r: an object, not in the data, so where it stands is unknown (perhaps the Fel Ancient's room). 3,950 XP at Shylamiir in Stormwind (chapter 30)
[OC]|cffffcc00?|r Heart of Disruption (92458) - the Arcane Mote from the Shade of the Archmage - |cFFFF0000grind/luck, one kill only|r: Wowhead Forever shows 40.75% (counted over kills by players without the quest). If the Mote is not in his loot, do not re-run: abandon the quest at Modera. 3,950 XP at Modera, and Friend of the Kirin Tor (265 XP) after it
Kill 8 [TAR247003 Seeking Remnant], 8 [TAR247001 Saturated Remnant] and 8 [TAR246600 Mana Echo] on the clear (no positions for the Seeking Remnants in the data) [QC92457] [G17.1,67.2 Alterac Mountains]
[OC]|cffffcc00Trash loot (bind on equip):|r |cff66ff66Violet Sorcerer's Leggings|r (cloth legs +13 Int +5 Spi +12 spell damage, req 29; Saturated Remnants and others) score 51.3 on the weights, keep them. Roused Nature Footwraps (leather boots +6 Sta +9 Spi, healing) 30.5; Violet Sorcerer's Wraps (cloth gloves +9 Int, +1% hit) about 16.3, below Zodiac Gloves 22.1
Take a Fel Infused Blossom (the object is not in the data: look round the Fel Ancient's room first, unverified) [QC92456] [G16.7,67.7 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Fel Ancient):|r |cff66ff66Blightleaf Rope|r (cloth belt +10 Int +7 spell damage) 25.4, beats the Violet Sash, not Daewyn's Girdle 29.0 or the Demolition Girdle 34.0. Garb of Fallen Felbark (leather chest +9 Agi +7 Sta +13 Int) 23.5 loses to a Raptorbane or Snapbrook chest and to the Violet Sorcerer's Robes. Felbough Arm is a polearm: pass
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Mana Devourer):|r Spine of the Devourer (staff 20.7 dps +14 Sta +36 spell damage) is below every two-hander you carry; Slitherwrap Girdle and the Manascale Treads (mail): pass
Kill [TAR246016 Arcanic Enigma], the Mana Elemental [QC92489] [G21.2,63.1 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Arcanic Enigma):|r |cff66ff66Violet Sorcerer's Robes|r (cloth chest +15 Int +9 spell damage) 35.1 on the weights, the chest of the run, ROLL. |cff66ff66Drape of Shifting Energy|r (cloak +7 Spi +12 attack power) 29.5, beats the Glowing Thresher Cape and the Dustcover. The wand: pass
[O]Kill [TAR246020 Shade of the Archmage] and loot the Arcane Mote [QC92458] (~41% - one kill only: no Mote, no re-run) [G15.2,55.9 Alterac Mountains]
[OC][A Shaman] |cffffcc00Loot (Shade of the Archmage):|r Archmagister's Faceted Pendant (neck +6 Int +12 attack power) 18.8, only over a neck weaker than the Giantstone Medallion or Thermaplugg Medal (25.0). Violet Sorcerer's Mantle (+9 Int) and the Ponderous Orb (off-hand): pass. Babagahnoosh drops only a Dalaran Mana Gem
[OC]|cffffcc00Leaving:|r walk out the way you came, back to Modera outside the city

[OC]|cffffffffHand-ins outside|r  -  Modera and Archmage Celindra stand a few steps apart
At [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera], [QT92457] (3,950 XP) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r Fallen Guard's Pendant (+3 Str) or the Arcane Infused Rod (off-hand, no use with a two-hander): vendor either [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
[O]At [TAR269127 Image of Archmage Modera], [QT92458] (3,950 XP, only with the Arcane Mote) - |cffffcc00Gear:|r |cff66ff66Defender of Dalaran|r (2H mace 31.21 dps +9 Str +13 Sta +9 Int, 465.2 on the weights) beats Heavehammer and the Crowd Pummeler, unless you won Thermaplugg's Left Arm (476.8); then Renewing Footpads (leather boots +5 Sta +11 Int, 20.5) only if your boots score under that (Disjointed Shoes are 22.0). Spellguard Pauldrons are mail [G14.3,59.6 Alterac Mountains]
